        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-17T19:41:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The other option would be to append and then memset:\n\n    T* padding \u003d fStorage.append(paddingSize);\n    memset(padding, 0, paddingSize);\n    \nthen we have no dependency on the max required alignment we can encounter.",
      "parentUuid": "7b7230e9_f5f6c2c4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 554,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 554,
